OL,3,GNEWSABudget 2026: How it is going to
OL,4,Aimpact us
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #100 payment to help millions of
OL,7,Fhouseholds with soaring energy bills
OL,8,Fand an extension to the fuel duty
OL,9,Fdiscount were among the announcements
OL,10,Fin the 2026 Autumn Budget.
OL,12,FIt was John Healey's first Budget as
OL,13,Fchancellor, and he said it had offered
OL,14,F"breathing space" to people with
OL,15,Fpressure on their finances.
OL,17,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,18,Fresponded that it was "not good enough,
OL,19,Fnot strong enough, not bold enough",
OL,20,Fwhile the Lib Dems urged the government
OL,21,Fto "fix our trading relationship with
OL,22,FEurope".
